  "worked_solution": "From the table, notice that\n\n$$\nP(Z\\le 3.0902)=0.999.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\nP(Z\\ge 3.0902)=1-0.999=0.001.\n$$\n\nBy the symmetry of the standard normal distribution, we have\n\n$$\nΦ(-3.0902)=0.001.\n$$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14263990/assets/12d4d863466f8a7c1ff72d5c08fed94097ac23d94e04a2976603a3f3a78f6261.png)\n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Φ(-3.0902) & =0.001 \\\\ P(Z\\le -3.0902) & =0.001.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the required value of $z$ is $-3.0902.$",
